{"seq":2,"slug":"ansible-practice","title":"Ansible 自动化实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/configuration-management/ansible-practice","wordCount":1404,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ansible-自动化实战\">Ansible 自动化实战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Ansible 是当前最流行的开源自动化平台，以无代理架构（Agentless）和 YAML 声明式语法著称。Ansible 通过 SSH（Linux）或 WinRM（Windows）连接目标主机，将模块（Module）推送到远端执行，执行完成后自动清理。这种架构消除了在目标主机上安装和维护代理软件的运维负担，使 Ansible 成为快速上手的自动化工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[控制节点] --&gt;|SSH/WinRM| B[目标主机 1]&#10;    A --&gt;|SSH/WinRM| C[目标主机 2]&#10;    A --&gt;|SSH/WinRM| D[目标主机 N]&#10;    E[Inventory 清单] --&gt; A&#10;    F[Playbook 剧本] --&gt; A&#10;    G[Roles/Collections] --&gt; A&#10;    A --&gt; H[模块推送与执行]&#10;    H --&gt; I[返回 JSON 结果]&#10;    I --&gt; J[状态汇总报告]\">graph LR\n    A[控制节点] --&gt;|SSH/WinRM| B[目标主机 1]\n    A --&gt;|SSH/WinRM| C[目标主机 2]\n    A --&gt;|SSH/WinRM| D[目标主机 N]\n    E[Inventory 清单] --&gt; A\n    F[Playbook 剧本] --&gt; A\n    G[Roles/Collections] --&gt; A\n    A --&gt; H[模块推送与执行]\n    H --&gt; I[返回 JSON 结果]\n    I --&gt; J[状态汇总报告]</pre><p>Ansible 核心组件职责：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>文件/格式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Inventory</td>\n<td>定义目标主机和分组</td>\n<td>INI/YAML/动态脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Playbook</td>\n<td>编排任务执行流程</td>\n<td>YAML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Module</td>\n<td>原子操作执行单元</td>\n<td>Python（内置 3000+）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Role</td>\n<td>可复用的任务封装</td>\n<td>标准目录结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Collection</td>\n<td>角色+模块+插件的分发单元</td>\n<td>Ansible Galaxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plugin</td>\n<td>扩展核心功能（连接、过滤、回调）</td>\n<td>Python</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vault</td>\n<td>敏感数据加密存储</td>\n<td>AES-256 加密文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"inventory-与主机管理\">Inventory 与主机管理</h2><p>Inventory 定义了 Ansible 可操作的目标主机及其分组关系。静态 Inventory 使用 INI 或 YAML 格式编写，适合固定规模的基础设施。动态 Inventory 通过脚本或插件从云平台 API、CMDB 或服务注册中心实时获取主机列表，适合弹性伸缩的云原生环境。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"all:&#10;  children:&#10;    webservers:&#10;      hosts:&#10;        web-sg-01:&#10;          ansible_host: 10.0.1.10&#10;        web-sg-02:&#10;          ansible_host: 10.0.1.11&#10;      vars:&#10;        http_port: 8080&#10;        max_connections: 1000&#10;    databases:&#10;      hosts:&#10;        db-sg-01:&#10;          ansible_host: 10.0.2.10&#10;          postgresql_version: &#39;16&#39;&#10;      vars:&#10;        backup_schedule: &#39;0 2 * * *&#39;&#10;  vars:&#10;    ansible_user: deploy&#10;    ansible_ssh_private_key_file: ~/.ssh/deploy_key\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    webservers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        web-sg-01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ansible_host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.0.1.10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        web-sg-02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ansible_host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.0.1.11</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      vars</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        http_port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        max_connections</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    databases</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        db-sg-01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ansible_host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.0.2.10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          postgresql_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'16'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      vars</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        backup_schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0 2 * * *'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  vars</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ansible_user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deploy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ansible_ssh_private_key_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">~/.ssh/deploy_key</span></span></code></pre></div><p>主机变量的优先级遵循从低到高的链式覆盖：Inventory defaults → group_vars/all → group_vars/ → host_vars/ → Playbook vars → extra-vars（<code>-e</code>）。这种分层机制允许在不同粒度上定义和覆盖配置，<code>group_vars</code> 和 <code>host_vars</code> 目录按约定名称自动加载。</p>\n<p>动态 Inventory 插件（如 <code>amazon.aws.aws_ec2</code>、<code>azure.azcollection.azure_rm</code>）通过 API 查询实例列表，支持按标签、区域和实例状态过滤。缓存机制减少 API 调用频率，TTL 配置平衡实时性和性能。企业环境推荐将动态 Inventory 与 CMDB 集成，确保 Ansible 操作的主机范围与资产管理系统一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"playbook-编排与任务设计\">Playbook 编排与任务设计</h2><p>Playbook 是 Ansible 的核心编排文件，定义了在哪些主机上按什么顺序执行哪些任务。每个 Play 指定目标主机组和要执行的任务列表，多个 Play 组成一个 Playbook。任务（Task）调用模块执行原子操作，Handler 在被通知时执行一次性操作（如重启服务）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Deploy web application&#10;  hosts: webservers&#10;  become: true&#10;  vars:&#10;    app_version: &#39;2.5.0&#39;&#10;    deploy_dir: /opt/webapp&#10;&#10;  pre_tasks:&#10;    - name: Verify connectivity&#10;      ansible.builtin.ping:&#10;&#10;  roles:&#10;    - role: common&#10;      tags: [base]&#10;    - role: nginx&#10;      vars:&#10;        nginx_worker_processes: auto&#10;      tags: [web]&#10;&#10;  tasks:&#10;    - name: Deploy application artifact&#10;      ansible.builtin.unarchive:&#10;        src: &#39;https://releases.example.com/webapp-{{ app_version }}.tar.gz&#39;&#10;        dest: &#39;{{ deploy_dir }}&#39;&#10;        remote_src: true&#10;      notify: restart webapp&#10;&#10;    - name: Configure application&#10;      ansible.builtin.template:&#10;        src: app-config.yml.j2&#10;        dest: &#39;{{ deploy_dir }}/config.yml&#39;&#10;        owner: webapp&#10;        group: webapp&#10;        mode: &#39;0640&#39;&#10;      notify: restart webapp&#10;&#10;  handlers:&#10;    - name: restart webapp&#10;      ansible.builtin.systemd:&#10;        name: webapp&#10;        state: restarted&#10;        enabled: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deploy web application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webservers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  become</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  vars</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.5.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    deploy_dir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/opt/webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pre_tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Verify connectivity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ansible.builtin.ping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  roles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">common</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nginx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      vars</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        nginx_worker_processes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">auto</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deploy application artifact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ansible.builtin.unarchive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://releases.example.com/webapp-{{ app_version }}.tar.gz'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        dest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ deploy_dir }}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        remote_src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      notify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">restart webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Configure application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ansible.builtin.template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-config.yml.j2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        dest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ deploy_dir }}/config.yml'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0640'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      notify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">restart webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  handlers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">restart webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ansible.builtin.systemd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">restarted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><p>任务设计的最佳实践包括：使用完全限定集合名称（FQCN，如 <code>ansible.builtin.copy</code>）避免命名冲突；通过 <code>block/rescue/always</code> 结构实现错误处理和回滚；使用 <code>when</code> 条件控制任务执行；通过 <code>loop</code> 和 <code>with_*</code> 实现批量操作；使用 <code>register</code> 捕获任务结果供后续任务使用。</p>\n<p>执行策略通过 <code>strategy</code> 参数控制，<code>linear</code>（默认）在所有主机上逐任务同步执行，<code>free</code> 允许每个主机独立推进不等待其他主机，<code>host_pinned</code> 在单个主机上执行完所有任务再切换。滚动部署通过 <code>serial</code> 参数实现，按批次在主机子集上执行，保证服务的持续可用性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ansible-vault-与安全实践\">Ansible Vault 与安全实践</h2><p>Ansible Vault 提供内置的敏感数据加密机制，使用 AES-256 对称加密算法保护密码、密钥和证书等机密信息。加密可以应用于整个文件或文件内的单个变量值（Inline Vault），后者的粒度更细，便于代码审查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"database_config:&#10;  host: db-production.internal&#10;  port: 5432&#10;  username: app_service&#10;  password: !vault |&#10;    $ANSIBLE_VAULT;1.1;AES256&#10;    6261636b656e645f70617373776f72643d&#10;    ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">database_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db-production.internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  username</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app_service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  password</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!vault</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    $ANSIBLE_VAULT;1.1;AES256</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    6261636b656e645f70617373776f72643d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Vault 密码的管理方式包括：交互式输入（<code>--ask-vault-pass</code>）、密码文件（<code>--vault-password-file</code>）和脚本获取（从密钥管理系统动态读取）。多 Vault ID 机制支持不同安全级别使用不同密码，如 <code>dev</code> 和 <code>prod</code> 环境各自独立的加密密钥。</p>\n<p>企业安全实践还包括：最小权限 SSH 用户（避免 root 直连）、<code>become</code> 机制的细粒度 sudo 配置、连接超时和重试策略、敏感输出的 <code>no_log: true</code> 标记、以及审计日志的集中收集。AWX/Ansible Tower 提供 RBAC 权限模型和执行审计功能，适合多团队协作的企业环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试与-ci-cd-集成\">测试与 CI/CD 集成</h2><p>Ansible 自动化代码同样需要测试保障。Molecule 是 Ansible 角色的标准测试框架，支持在 Docker、Vagrant 或云实例中自动创建测试环境、执行 Playbook、验证结果并清理资源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试阶段</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法检查</td>\n<td><code>ansible-lint</code>、<code>yamllint</code></td>\n<td>YAML 语法、最佳实践违规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td><code>ansible-lint</code> 自定义规则</td>\n<td>安全规则、命名规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>Molecule + Docker</td>\n<td>角色功能正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>Molecule + 云实例</td>\n<td>多角色交互、端到端流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等性测试</td>\n<td>Molecule 二次运行</td>\n<td>重复执行无变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CI/CD 集成将 Ansible 执行嵌入自动化流水线。GitLab CI、GitHub Actions 和 Jenkins 通过 Ansible 插件或直接调用 <code>ansible-playbook</code> 命令执行部署任务。Pipeline 设计遵循 Lint → Test → Deploy Staging → Verify → Deploy Production 的阶段模型，每个阶段的失败都会阻止后续执行。</p>\n<p>Ansible 与 Terraform 的协同模式是现代基础设施自动化的典型架构：Terraform 完成资源创建后通过 <code>local-exec</code> 或 <code>remote-exec</code> Provisioner 触发 Ansible Playbook，或者 Terraform 输出动态 Inventory 供 Ansible 消费。两者的职责边界明确：Terraform 管理资源生命周期，Ansible 管理系统配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Ansible 以无代理架构和 YAML 语法降低自动化门槛，通过 SSH 推送模块执行</li>\n<li>Inventory 支持静态和动态两种模式，变量优先级链实现多层级配置覆盖</li>\n<li>Playbook 通过 Play、Task、Handler 和 Role 四层抽象编排复杂部署流程</li>\n<li>Vault 提供 AES-256 加密保护敏感数据，支持文件级和变量级两种粒度</li>\n<li>Molecule 框架覆盖语法检查到幂等性测试的完整质量链</li>\n<li>Ansible 与 Terraform 协同形成资源编排+系统配置的完整自动化体系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Ansible 自动化实战","id":"ansible-自动化实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Inventory 与主机管理","id":"inventory-与主机管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Playbook 编排与任务设计","id":"playbook-编排与任务设计"},{"level":2,"text":"Ansible Vault 与安全实践","id":"ansible-vault-与安全实践"},{"level":2,"text":"测试与 CI/CD 集成","id":"测试与-ci-cd-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"配置管理概述与工具生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/configuration-management/config-management-overview"},"next":{"title":"不可变基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/configuration-management/immutable-infrastructure"}}